# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# LLM Integration (Hugging Face)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# To enable the LLM agent (Claude/Llama via Hugging Face), you must 
# provide a valid Hugging Face API token below.
# 
# 1. Create an account at https://huggingface.co
# 2. Go to Settings > Access Tokens and create a new token (read role).
# 3. Paste the token below.
#
# If left as a placeholder or empty, the app will automatically and safely 
# fall back to the local regex/fuzzy-matching NLP handler, meaning the
# core features will continue to work perfectly without an LLM.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
